Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Merge pull request #318 from
 Brontir/fix/engine-survives-request-errors

Engine: one request's failure no longer stops the server
(cherry picked from commit 7fe1dece6dbbbaf3ab7b76110cd090af5b5a6905)
---
